\subsection*{Nomination Procedures}

\noindent
Nominations for the Board of Directors may be submitted in writing in advance using the
nomination form included in this packet, or may be made from the floor at the Annual Meeting.
{% if election.nomination_deadline %}
Advance nominations must be received by \textbf{ {{ election.nomination_deadline | format_date }} }.
{% endif %}
{% if election.nomination_from_floor %}
Nominations from the floor will be accepted at the Annual Meeting.
{% endif %}

\subsection*{Voting Procedure}

\noindent
Voting will be conducted at the Annual Meeting. Each unit is entitled to \textbf{one (1) vote}.
Unit owners may vote in person or by proxy.
{% if election.ballot_required %}
A written ballot will be distributed at the meeting.
{% else %}
Voting may be conducted by voice vote, show of hands, or written ballot at the discretion
of the presiding officer.
{% endif %}

\noindent
\textbf{Proxy Reminder:} Unit owners unable to attend in person may vote in the board election
by submitting a valid proxy. See the Proxy Form included in this packet.

{% if jx.org_meeting_after_annual %}
\subsection*{Following the Election: Organizational Meeting}

\noindent
Immediately following the Annual Meeting of Unit Owners, the newly constituted Board of Directors
will hold its Organizational Meeting to elect officers (President, Vice President, Secretary, and
Treasurer) for the ensuing year.
{% endif %}
